  <CB_GeneTampering_Behavior.roles.1.missingDesc>一个目标</CB_GeneTampering_Behavior.roles.1.missingDesc>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.comps.0.label>参与者数量</CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: A choice is to be made.-->
  <CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.description>需要做出选择。</CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.description>
  <!--EN: Choice for gene tampering-->
  <CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.outcomeChances.0.description>基因篡改的选择</CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Ten fervor to remove an unwanted gene.\n  - Each point of complexity requires additonal ten fervor.\n  - Double for adding a learned gene\n  - Half of that when targeting an unborn.\n\nIf pregnant, only the child can be targeted for-->
  <CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.outcomeChances.0.label>消耗十点狂热以移除一个不需要的基因。\n  - 每点复杂度需要额外十点狂热。\n  - 添加一个已学习的基因消耗翻倍。\n  - 以未出生后代为目标时消耗减半。\n\n如果目标已怀孕，则只能以胎儿为目标。</CB_GeneTampering_Outcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on the ritual outcome, all participants gain a bonus to their fertility.
	\nThis overcomes infertility due to old age.
	\nAdditional Sacred Fervor can be spent for even more fertility.-->
  <CB_SacredFertility.description>根据仪式结果，所有参与者的生育力将获得加成。
	\n这将克服因年老导致的不孕。
	\n可以消耗额外的神圣狂热以获得更高的生育力。</CB_SacredFertility.description>
  <!--EN: Depending on the ritual outcome, all participants gain a bonus to their fertility.
	\nThis overcomes infertility due to old age.
	\nAdditional Sacred Fervor can be spent for even more fertility.-->
